#
# Test that a VSHUFFLE writing ex2 is not scheduled too close before a
# VMAC_f_vmac_bfp16 that reads the OLD ex2 value through sub-registers
# ewl2/ewh2. The anti-dependency between the VMAC (reader) and the second
# VSHUFFLE (writer) must have a signed latency of 0, not -1.
# Without the fix, the second VSHUFFLE would be placed one cycle before
# the VMAC instead of in the same cycle.
#
# RUN: llc -mtriple=aie2ps -run-pass=postmisched %s -o - \
# RUN:   | FileCheck %s

